<Layouts.app flash={@flash}>
  <article id="privacy-page" class="lbm-about">
    <header class="lbm-hero lbm-about-hero">
      <p class="lbm-eyebrow">Privacy</p>
      <h1 class="lbm-hero-title">Privacy policy</h1>
      <p class="lbm-hero-lede">
        The short version: this site collects only what you choose to send, uses it only to reply to
        you, and never sells or shares it. There are no analytics, ads or trackers.
      </p>
    </header>

    <section
      id="privacy-collect"
      class="lbm-about-section"
      aria-labelledby="privacy-collect-heading"
    >
      <h2 id="privacy-collect-heading">What's collected</h2>
      <p>
        <strong>Tutoring inquiries.</strong>
        When you send the form on the <.link navigate={~p"/services"}>Services</.link>
        page, your name, email address, the offering you picked and your message are saved so I can
        reply. Only I can see them.
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong>Topic suggestions.</strong>
        The Suggest a Topic form saves only the text of your suggestion. It doesn't ask for your name
        or email.
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong>IP addresses.</strong>
        Both forms briefly check your IP address to stop spam (a limit on how many messages can be
        sent in a few minutes). It's held in memory for a short time and never saved.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section
      id="privacy-cookies"
      class="lbm-about-section"
      aria-labelledby="privacy-cookies-heading"
    >
      <h2 id="privacy-cookies-heading">Cookies and storage</h2>
      <p>
        The site sets one cookie, which the forms need to work securely. It doesn't track you across
        sites. If you pick a light or dark theme, that choice is saved in your own browser and never
        sent anywhere.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section id="privacy-dont" class="lbm-about-section" aria-labelledby="privacy-dont-heading">
      <h2 id="privacy-dont-heading">What isn't done</h2>
      <p>
        No analytics, no advertising, no tracking pixels, and no selling or sharing of your
        information. Your email address is used only to reply to your inquiry.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section id="privacy-keep" class="lbm-about-section" aria-labelledby="privacy-keep-heading">
      <h2 id="privacy-keep-heading">Keeping and deleting</h2>
      <p>
        Inquiries are kept only as long as they're useful for replying and scheduling. You can ask
        for yours to be deleted at any time by emailing <a
          href={"mailto:#{@contact_email}"}
          id="privacy-contact"
        >{@contact_email}</a>.
      </p>
      <p>
        If you're under 13, please have a parent or guardian send the inquiry for you.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section
      id="privacy-hosting"
      class="lbm-about-section"
      aria-labelledby="privacy-hosting-heading"
    >
      <h2 id="privacy-hosting-heading">Hosting and changes</h2>
      <p>
        The site and its database are hosted on Railway. If this policy changes, the date below will
        change with it.
      </p>
      <p class="lbm-privacy-updated">Last updated November 15, 2026.</p>
    </section>
  </article>
</Layouts.app>
